action "Run topgrade (system update)"
exec  sudo -n -v
auth  password -> <correct>
exec  su -s /usr/bin/true $USER
exec  sudo -S -v
exec  sudo -n -v
note  "sudo didn't keep your password for this terminal (sudo's ticket isn't reusable here, e.g. timestamp_timeout=0). topgrade and yay would then ask for it directly on the terminal, outside archmaid. Run this from archmaid-gui, or allow sudo to keep the ticket."
end   outcome=cancelled errs=0 skipped=0
